Content and book art (not licensed with the code)
-------------------------------------------------

The adhkar texts are taken from the printed product «حصن الطفل», supplied by
the content owner (see docs/SOURCES.md). The text of adhkar-dressing was copied
from the owner's drawn page and is pending a check against the printed book.

Book art in apps/qindeel/public/book/ (cover-bg.jpg, cover-top.png,
page-bg.jpg, top-logo.png, dua-*.png) comes from the content owner's
«حصن الطفل» design files. top-logo.png is derived from one of them with areas
cleared; see docs/ASSETS.md.

All rights in the texts and the art remain with their owner. They are included
to run this application and may not be reused without the owner's permission.

Fonts
-----

Aref Ruqaa, IBM Plex Sans Arabic and Amiri: SIL Open Font License 1.1, served
through next/font (self-hosted at build time). Amiri is still loaded and is due
to be removed.

Dependencies
------------

- Next.js, React, React DOM, zod: MIT
- lucide-react: ISC
- ai (Vercel AI SDK): Apache-2.0

Full licence texts ship with each package in node_modules.

External services (optional, off by default)
--------------------------------------------

Vercel AI Gateway (text) and fal.ai (pictures) are called only when
AI_ENABLED / AI_IMAGES_ENABLED are true. No model weights or generated
pictures are included in this repository.
